  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7265114aa1e7f41ada19d74a427f9e13, type: 3}
  m_Name: SpringPlaygroundCard
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: xpTURN.Feedback.Samples::xpTURN.Feedback.Samples.SampleCard
  Title: Spring Playground
  Try: Drag the ring with the mouse or step it a cell with the arrows. Change the
    frequency and the damping, then drag again.
  See: "Grey: SpringFloat (the bar), SpringVector2 (the disc) and SpringVector3 (the
    cube) stepped in code \u2014 the sliders set them. Blue: a MotionDriver following
    the same target, its spring fixed in the scene. Moving the target keeps the velocity.
    Bump and MoveTo are Spring motions on players; Before turns only those off."
  Controls: "Drag \xB7 arrows \xB7 Left stick \u2014 target \xB7 Z X C V \xB7 D-pad
    \u2014 spring \xB7 2 \xB7 3 \u2014 Bump \xB7 MoveTo"
  SceneGuid: 6db32d8aad1bb4038aec29e1d8810c7f
  SceneName: SpringPlayground
  RequiredType: xpTURN.Feedback.Samples.GameFeelLabs.SpringPlayground, xpTURN.Feedback.Samples.GameFeelLabs.Springs
  RequiresText: 
  OpenInEditor: 0
